[NAME]
gmman \- get documentation for GantMagic keywords or generate user manual

[ENVIRONMENT]

.TP
\fBBROWSER\fR
The web browser used to display the user manual as HTML.

[EXAMPLES]

gmman shift
.br
gmman --html shift.timesheet
.br
gmman --html

[SEE ALSO]

gm(1)

The GantMagic manual is also available online at https://example.com/gantmagic/manual/.
